00:53:17,061 --> 00:53:18,766
Speaker 2: We don't want to hate and despise one another.

623
00:53:19,488 --> 00:53:23,900
Speaker 2: In this world there's room for everyone, and the good earth is rich and can provide for everyone.

624
00:53:24,500 --> 00:53:28,507
Speaker 2: The way of life can be free and beautiful, but we have lost the way.

