00:53:43,494 --> 00:53:46,680
Speaker 2: Our knowledge has made us cynical, our cleverness hard and unkind.

629
00:53:47,380 --> 00:53:49,465
Speaker 2: We think too much and feel too little.

630
00:53:50,167 --> 00:53:52,332
Speaker 2: More than machinery, we need humanity.

631
00:53:52,813 --> 00:53:55,620
Speaker 2: More than cleverness, we need kindness and gentleness.

632
00:53:56,320 --> 00:53:59,670
Speaker 2: Without these qualities, life will be violent and all will be lost.

